{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id215501464"}, "name":{"label":"Brey's Opinions"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-05T13:03:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"14631846924"}, "title":{"label":"10/10 recommend"}, "content":{"label":"I LOVE this app! I signed up as a teacher and assign activities for my kiddo to do before she can play around with the other features. As a homeschool mom, this is such an amazing resource that I can use to support our lessons. There are also tons of books for kids to read with the option to select “read to me” for those who can’t read independently yet. \n\nI desperately wish this app went up to 6th grade! (Through elementary grades) I understand Khan academy supports 3rd grade and on. However, it doesn’t include the same interface and child-friendly fun. The holiday themes are a favorite of ours!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1378467217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
