{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id149938270"}, "name":{"label":"GoodMom413"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-29T00:44:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.0"}, "id":{"label":"14361503748"}, "title":{"label":"Great App overall"}, "content":{"label":"I love many features of this app. Kahn academy was a life saver being suggested when I went back to school. It helped me to brush up on the basics before taking entrance exams for college. \n\nMy only reason for not giving a 5 star rating is the kids app is missing 1 crucial feature. It needs a timer feature to block out non learning content. I was getting so frustrated using this with my daughter because instead of sticking to the learning paths she’d go to the bug area, or the change clothes features.\n\n The additional content that is mindless or wastes time is unhelpful when you only allow your child a short window for screen time. The parental controls should allow you to block out features. Or, create a timer or goal for the learning path before those other features become available. \n\nIf you could help with this It’d make this my go-to screen time activity.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1378467217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
